  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">黏性附魔青金石是一款生活品質模組，對附魔桌進行了一些修改。關閉選單後，青金石仍會保留在附魔桌內。它支援伺服器環境，玩家之間可共用青金石。即使多名玩家同時開啟附魔介面，青金石數量也會自動同步更新。破壞附魔桌時，內部保留的青金石也會掉落。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>關閉選單後，青金石將保留在附魔桌內：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/sticky-enchanting-lapis/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>破壞附魔桌時，內部包含的青金石將會掉落：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/sticky-enchanting-lapis/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>附魔桌介面會在伺服器端同步更新。可與其他玩家同時使用，並共用內部青金石：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/sticky-enchanting-lapis/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍位於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有模組的概覽與更多詳細資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 存放庫</a> 提出。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
